    {
      "ordinal": 38,
      "start_ms": 104520,
      "end_ms": 105480,
      "text": "懂了吧"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 39,
      "start_ms": 105480,
      "end_ms": 107460,
      "text": "无可何时也知道我要生存"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 40,
      "start_ms": 107460,
      "end_ms": 108960,
      "text": "但是我吃了这个转基因啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 41,
      "start_ms": 108960,
      "end_ms": 110820,
      "text": "或者说反转接呀"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 42,
      "start_ms": 110820,
      "end_ms": 113430,
      "text": "他就是把这个矛盾给他表象化"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 43,
